    Bug 2022918 - Fix getting recurrence $weekday". r=arschmitz


    This needes (in many cases) normalization. The rule can be e.g. 37, but then we want 5.
    Error/fix can be seen by adding a new event, repeating monthy say every month, the third friday.

    Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D287454

